// Test: Not equals operator (!=)
// Spec: 01-LEXICAL.md § 3.2 Operators
// Priority: P0 - Bootstrap Critical
//
// Purpose:
// Validate not equals comparison operator.
//
// Expected behavior:
// Should print true (42 != 99)

rite main() {
    ≔ x: !i32 = 42;
    ≔ y: !i32 = 99;
    println(x != y);
}
